    3: { sharp: "Why?", dry: "Why them?", loud: "WHY them?", soft: "Why them?", odd: "Why them? Convince me." },
    4: { sharp: "They take us the second they can. We go first.", dry: "They'd take us. We go first.", loud: "Because they'll take US the SECOND they get the chance! So we get there FIRST!", soft: "Because they'll take us the second they get a chance. So we get there first.", odd: "They'd pick us in a heartbeat. We pick them in half a heartbeat." },
    5: { sharp: "And the vote?", dry: "At the vote?", loud: "And at the VOTE?", soft: "And at the vote?", odd: "And at the vote? Same song?" },
    6: { sharp: "Same names. Make sure enough people say them.", dry: "Same names.", loud: "SAME names! Let's make SURE enough people SAY them!", soft: "Same names. Let's make sure enough people say them.", odd: "Same names. Same song. We need a choir." },
    7: { sharp: "A partner who thinks like you: two votes, one plan.", dry: "Two votes, one plan.", loud: "THAT'S the good thing about a partner who thinks like you! TWO votes, ONE plan!", soft: "That's the good thing about having a partner who thinks like you. Two votes, one plan.", odd: "A partner who thinks like me. Two votes, one brain. A big brain." },
